title: 'sc-hop: add Prometheus metrics'
doc:
  - audience: Node Operator
    description: |
      Adds Prometheus metrics to sc-hop:

      - `substrate_hop_pool_entries` / `substrate_hop_pool_bytes` / `substrate_hop_pool_max_bytes` (gauges)
      - `substrate_hop_pool_inserted_bytes_total` (counter)
      - `substrate_hop_pool_removed_total` (counter; `reason` one of `acked`, `expired_promoted`, `expired_unpromoted`, `corrupt`, `startup_dropped`; all series pre-created at registration; `expired_unpromoted` is an upper bound on loss)
      - `substrate_hop_rpc_errors_total` (counter; `method` is the wire name, `reason` the `HopError` variant)
      - `substrate_hop_promotions_confirmed_total` (counter)
      - `substrate_hop_promotion_backlog` (gauge, snapshot once per maintenance cycle)
      - `substrate_hop_maintenance_ticks_total` (counter, maintenance-loop liveness)

      API (additive): `HopParams::build_pool_with_metrics`, `HopDataPool::new_with_metrics` and `HopDataPool::cleanup_expired_with_backlog` take the registry / metrics / promotion window; the existing `build_pool`, `new` and `cleanup_expired` keep their signatures and run without metrics. A metrics registration failure only disables metrics. The omni-node passes its existing registry.
crates:
  - name: sc-hop
    bump: minor
  - name: polkadot-omni-node-lib
    bump: patch
